WEBVTT

1
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.458
In verses 13.18

2
00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:46.958
and 13.19,

3
00:00:46.958 --> 00:00:47.583
Lord Krishna

4
00:00:47.583 --> 00:00:50.625
concludes His discussion on the
object of knowledge

5
00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:52.958
and reveals the Paramatma as the supreme

6
00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:55.416
subject of jnana.

7
00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:57.708
He summarises that kshetra,

8
00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:00.041
the body,

9
00:01:00.041 --> 00:01:02.375
jnana - knowledge, and jneya -
the object of knowledge,

10
00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:04.000
have been described in brief.

11
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.000
He emphasises

12
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.166
that only His devotees, mad-bhakta,

13
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:11.666
can fully understand these principles

14
00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:14.500
and thereby attain His

15
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.125
eternal nature.

16
00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:22.791
Lord Krishna declares

17
00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:25.583
the light of all luminous things,

18
00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:29.333
that He is - “jyotisham api tat jyotih”,

19
00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:31.166
including the sun,

20
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:35.083
moon, and stars.

21
00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:36.583
In the spiritual world,

22
00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:37.708
His divine radiance,

23
00:01:37.708 --> 00:01:40.000
called brahma-jyoti,

24
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:40.958
eliminates the need

25
00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:42.000
for any external

26
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.333
source of light.

27
00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:47.041
This radiance is beyond the darkness of matter,

28
00:01:47.041 --> 00:01:49.416
that is - “tamsah param”.

29
00:01:49.416 --> 00:01:52.250
This emphasises that the Supreme is beyond

30
00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.000
the limitations of the material world.

31
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.083
The spiritual realm

32
00:01:56.083 --> 00:01:59.166
is self-luminous through His divine presence.

33
00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:02.416
The phrase “jnanam jneyam jnana-gamyam”,

34
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:04.333
reveals that Lord Krishna

35
00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:06.208
is jnanam, knowledge itself,

36
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:07.375
jneyam,

37
00:02:07.375 --> 00:02:08.708
the object of knowledge,

38
00:02:08.708 --> 00:02:09.833
and jnana-gamyam,

39
00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:12.458
the goal of all knowledge.

40
00:02:12.458 --> 00:02:16.000
This means that gaining spiritual knowledge

41
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.416
not only illuminates the soul

42
00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:22.166
but also leads toward the direct
experience of the Supreme.

43
00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:23.583
To know Lord Krishna

44
00:02:23.583 --> 00:02:25.916
is the ultimate purpose of all knowledge.

45
00:02:25.916 --> 00:02:28.583
“Hridi sarvasya vishthitam”,

46
00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:30.291
He dwells in the hearts of all living beings

47
00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:32.833
as the Paramatma.

48
00:02:32.833 --> 00:02:34.583
He is the witness of all actions, thoughts,

49
00:02:34.583 --> 00:02:36.250
and desires,

50
00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:37.625
and guides the soul

51
00:02:37.625 --> 00:02:41.125
in accordance with its karma.

52
00:02:41.125 --> 00:02:43.916
Though always present,

53
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:46.750
He remains hidden from those whose minds

54
00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.375
are bound by material

55
00:02:48.375 --> 00:02:50.666
existence, because of His subtle nature.

56
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:52.708
In verse 13.19, Lord Krishna

57
00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:54.708
summarises the kshetra, the body,

58
00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:56.666
the jneya, the soul,

59
00:02:56.666 --> 00:02:57.958
the process of jnana,

60
00:02:57.958 --> 00:03:01.291
and the Paramatma.

61
00:03:01.291 --> 00:03:02.791
He then emphasises,

62
00:03:02.791 --> 00:03:05.000
“mad-bhakta etat vijnaya”,

63
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:05.583
that is

64
00:03:05.583 --> 00:03:08.333
only His devotees can fully understand

65
00:03:08.333 --> 00:03:09.958
these truths.

66
00:03:09.958 --> 00:03:12.750
Devotion removes the veil of ignorance

67
00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:13.500
and reveals the Lord

68
00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.541
as the supreme truth.

69
00:03:16.541 --> 00:03:20.291
Through this understanding,
“mad-bhavaya upapadyate”,

70
00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:21.208
meaning

71
00:03:21.208 --> 00:03:24.083
the devotee attains Lord Krishna's divine nature

72
00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:27.000
and transcends material existence.

73
00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.041
This highlights that devotion

74
00:03:29.041 --> 00:03:32.083
is not merely an ordinary process,

75
00:03:32.083 --> 00:03:34.375
but the supreme means

76
00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:37.375
of attaining complete knowledge and liberation.

77
00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:40.375
Others can only intellectually speculate

78
00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:41.333
about the true

79
00:03:41.333 --> 00:03:43.833
essence of the Bhagavad Gita.

80
00:03:43.833 --> 00:03:45.708
But a true devotee can understand it

81
00:03:45.708 --> 00:03:47.458
deeply

82
00:03:47.458 --> 00:03:52.208
and experience the presence of
the Supreme within the heart.

83
00:03:56.541 --> 00:03:59.416
Many people think

84
00:03:59.416 --> 00:04:02.333
that something cannot be accepted

85
00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:04.333
until it makes complete

86
00:04:04.333 --> 00:04:06.875
logical sense.

87
00:04:06.875 --> 00:04:09.041
But

88
00:04:09.041 --> 00:04:14.708
think about the universe,

89
00:04:14.708 --> 00:04:15.875
how much of it

90
00:04:15.875 --> 00:04:18.791
do you truly understand?

91
00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:25.791
Tell Me, can you understand through logic alone

92
00:04:25.791 --> 00:04:28.583
the depth of love,

93
00:04:28.583 --> 00:04:31.208
the experience of presence,

94
00:04:31.208 --> 00:04:36.500
or the strength that comes from surrender?

95
00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.666
Devotion is not blind faith.

96
00:04:39.666 --> 00:04:46.041
It is sincere trust made by the heart.

97
00:04:46.041 --> 00:04:50.041
It does not reject reason,

98
00:04:50.041 --> 00:04:52.500
but it does

99
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:57.166
recognise reason's limits.

100
00:04:57.166 --> 00:04:59.166
When you see life

101
00:04:59.166 --> 00:05:02.416
only through the intellect,

102
00:05:02.416 --> 00:05:06.833
you gather only information,

103
00:05:06.833 --> 00:05:09.958
while the heart

104
00:05:09.958 --> 00:05:12.666
remains untouched.

105
00:05:12.666 --> 00:05:15.416
Real understanding comes

106
00:05:15.416 --> 00:05:20.250
when you combine knowledge with devotion.

107
00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.958
When humility and sincerity

108
00:05:23.958 --> 00:05:28.166
bring you to this feeling,

109
00:05:28.166 --> 00:05:31.166
'I do not know everything,

110
00:05:31.166 --> 00:05:35.125
but I wish to learn.'

111
00:05:35.125 --> 00:05:38.833
You do not need

112
00:05:38.833 --> 00:05:43.000
to understand Me fully to connect with Me.

113
00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:48.125
Simply open your heart.

114
00:05:48.125 --> 00:05:50.083
Understand this.

115
00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:52.833
One small act

116
00:05:52.833 --> 00:05:56.750
of true devotion brings a clarity

117
00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:00.375
that hundreds of theories cannot.

118
00:06:00.375 --> 00:06:04.833
Devotion gives you inner strength,

119
00:06:04.833 --> 00:06:06.416
not because

120
00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:11.500
you control everything, but because

121
00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:15.375
you know

122
00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:19.583
who truly does.

123
00:06:19.583 --> 00:06:24.208
When you stop needing to analyse

124
00:06:24.208 --> 00:06:28.125
and begin to build a connection,

125
00:06:28.125 --> 00:06:30.666
something remarkable happens.

126
00:06:30.666 --> 00:06:35.500
You not only learn about Me,

127
00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:39.083
you begin to experience Me.

128
00:06:39.083 --> 00:06:41.000
Then knowledge

129
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.750
is no longer just information.

130
00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.458
It becomes life itself.

131
00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.125
Imagine

132
00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:55.541
how one simple truth

133
00:06:55.541 --> 00:06:59.750
could transform your family life.

134
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.750
If you always remembered,

135
00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:07.916
'I dwell in the hearts of your loved ones

136
00:07:07.916 --> 00:07:09.875
just as I dwell

137
00:07:09.875 --> 00:07:13.750
in yours.'

138
00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.375
This means

139
00:07:15.375 --> 00:07:19.458
that when you speak with your child,
your spouse,

140
00:07:19.458 --> 00:07:22.916
or your parents,

141
00:07:22.916 --> 00:07:27.416
you are not speaking only to a role.

142
00:07:27.416 --> 00:07:31.250
You are speaking to a soul.

143
00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:35.291
And since I am present

144
00:07:35.291 --> 00:07:38.500
in every soul,

145
00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:42.333
the one who listens is also Me.

146
00:07:42.333 --> 00:07:45.375
Knowing this,

147
00:07:45.375 --> 00:07:49.291
even in moments of tension,

148
00:07:49.291 --> 00:07:51.916
would you still raise

149
00:07:51.916 --> 00:07:55.750
your voice? Keep complaining?

150
00:07:55.750 --> 00:08:02.333
Argue just to win out of ego?

151
00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:06.500
Or rather than doing all this,

152
00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:10.791
 would you pause, breathe,

153
00:08:10.791 --> 00:08:13.375
and choose words

154
00:08:13.375 --> 00:08:18.000
that heal, not hurt?

155
00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:21.000
Even in moments of disagreement,

156
00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:25.333
this awareness brings gentleness.

157
00:08:25.333 --> 00:08:29.166
When you need to correct, guide,

158
00:08:29.166 --> 00:08:32.416
or express concern,

159
00:08:32.416 --> 00:08:37.708
you do so with dignity.

160
00:08:37.708 --> 00:08:39.833
You respond with patience

161
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:44.166
when children are stubborn.

162
00:08:44.166 --> 00:08:49.000
You understand a spouse's silence.

163
00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.666
You become more forgiving

164
00:08:51.666 --> 00:08:56.708
toward your parents' nature or flaws.

165
00:08:56.708 --> 00:09:00.875
Seeing Me in the hearts of your family members

166
00:09:00.875 --> 00:09:05.583
does not make you weak,

167
00:09:05.583 --> 00:09:09.916
it deepens your love.

168
00:09:09.916 --> 00:09:13.166
It moves you from reacting

169
00:09:13.166 --> 00:09:15.000
to every situation

170
00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:19.625
to building a relationship.

171
00:09:19.625 --> 00:09:23.208
And when this change happens,

172
00:09:23.208 --> 00:09:28.083
your home becomes a sacred place.

173
00:09:32.666 --> 00:09:34.416
In the Gita,

174
00:09:34.416 --> 00:09:38.458
I say that My devotees,

175
00:09:38.458 --> 00:09:43.250
those who come to Me with sincerity and love,

176
00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:46.541
can truly understand Me.

177
00:09:46.541 --> 00:09:49.916
Because real understanding

178
00:09:49.916 --> 00:09:52.458
does not come from logic alone.

179
00:09:52.458 --> 00:09:57.833
It also needs the heart.

180
00:09:57.833 --> 00:09:59.208
The same applies

181
00:09:59.208 --> 00:10:02.708
to your professional life.

182
00:10:02.708 --> 00:10:07.166
You may have all the data,

183
00:10:07.166 --> 00:10:10.583
calculations, and analysis.

184
00:10:10.583 --> 00:10:13.083
But if you are not

185
00:10:13.083 --> 00:10:16.791
emotionally connected with your colleagues,

186
00:10:16.791 --> 00:10:19.000
if you do not understand their fears,

187
00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:22.833
their hopes and their motivations,

188
00:10:22.833 --> 00:10:25.708
you will remain entirely incomplete

189
00:10:25.708 --> 00:10:28.916
in your understanding.

190
00:10:28.916 --> 00:10:30.750
Listen carefully,

191
00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:33.125
leading a team,

192
00:10:33.125 --> 00:10:37.333
resolving conflict, making the right decisions,

193
00:10:37.333 --> 00:10:41.000
all of these need both mind

194
00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.416
and heart.

195
00:10:43.416 --> 00:10:47.458
If you rely only on logic,

196
00:10:47.458 --> 00:10:51.916
you can become insensitive, disconnected,

197
00:10:51.916 --> 00:10:54.833
and even arrogant.

198
00:10:54.833 --> 00:10:59.791
And if you rely only on emotion,

199
00:10:59.791 --> 00:11:05.500
both purpose and direction can be lost.

200
00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:06.750
But when

201
00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.708
you use both together,

202
00:11:10.708 --> 00:11:13.416
you lead with insight

203
00:11:13.416 --> 00:11:18.541
and compassion, listen better,

204
00:11:18.541 --> 00:11:22.541
and respond wisely.

205
00:11:22.541 --> 00:11:25.625
People naturally

206
00:11:25.625 --> 00:11:28.000
come to trust you.

207
00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:31.541
So the next time you face

208
00:11:31.541 --> 00:11:34.750
a difficult situation at work,

209
00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:38.541
ask yourself two questions,

210
00:11:38.541 --> 00:11:42.416
First - 'What makes sense?'

211
00:11:42.416 --> 00:11:46.208
And second - 'What feels right?'

212
00:11:46.208 --> 00:11:49.458
This balance brings clarity.

213
00:11:49.458 --> 00:11:54.750
And it turns a good professional into a wise one.

214
00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:57.041
Balance of reason and feeling

215
00:11:57.041 --> 00:11:58.833
makes life joyful.
